{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@_NSRange","text":"NSRange","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"range","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"withCoordinates:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CLLocationCoordinate2D","text":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"coords","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"count:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSUInteger","text":"NSUInteger","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"count","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"range","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The range of vertices to replace. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"location"},{"type":"text","text":" field indicates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first vertex you are replacing, with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" being the first vertex, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"being the second vertex, and so on. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" field indicates the number"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of vertices to replace.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"coords","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The array of coordinates defining part of the shape. The data in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this array is copied to the shape’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"coordinates","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"count","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The number of coordinates from the ","type":"text"},{"code":"coords","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" array to insert in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"place of the coordinates in ","type":"text"},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The sum of ","type":"text"},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s length and this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"count must not exceed the number of items currently in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"coordinates","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the shape is currently visible on the map as an annotation, it is redrawn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"immediately. If the shape is part of an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object, you must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"explicitly set the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape","isActive":true},{"text":" property in order for any style","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layers that use the source to be redrawn.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is greater than the "},{"code":"length","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" field of "},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", some vertices will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"effectively be inserted into the shape. On the other hand, if "},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is less"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" field of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"range"},{"type":"text","text":", some vertices will effectively be removed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extends beyond the shape’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coordinates"},{"type":"text","text":" property, an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSRangeException"},{"text":" is raised. If you want to append new vertices to the shape,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"-appendCoordinates:count:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Replaces the vertices at the given range in the shape with the specified number","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of vertices from a given C array.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint"]]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint\/replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMultiPoint(im)replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","kind":"identifier"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint\/replacecoordinatesinrange:withcoordinates:count:"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"title":"MapLibre","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","role":"collection"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPoint":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" class is an abstract superclass used to define shapes"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"composed of multiple vertices."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNMultiPoint","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint","title":"MLNMultiPoint","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"title":"MLNStyle","abstract":[{"text":"The proxy object for the current map style.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyle","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSource","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyPr